    end

    I1 & I2 --> D1
    D1 --> API
    API --> SCORER & COLLISION
    API --> UI1
    API --> UI3
    SCORER & COLLISION --> CPSAT
    CPSAT --> HC & SC
    HC & SC --> CPSAT
    CPSAT --> UI2
    CPSAT --> API

